00:39:45.530 --> 00:39:48.835
time on legal contracts of
how not just about data,

00:39:48.835 --> 00:39:50.600
just about policies, right?

00:39:50.600 --> 00:39:52.910
So if we could just
take that away,

00:39:52.910 --> 00:39:55.490
which we do, to our
